            "review_title": "Review at Bánh Mì Ngon",
            "review_text": "BiancaC\nDevizes, United Kingdom1869 contributions\n1\nSuper friendly and lovely Banh Mi\nFeb 2026 • Couples\nWalked for ages to find breakfast.\nThis place was recommended by numerous nearby cafes.\nHad to wait a little as there were plenty of locals queuing up.\nSeating just inside.\nLovely ladies serving.\nEnglish menu, which replicates the Vietnamese board.\nThe chicken Banh Mi was good but the egg omelette Bahn Mi was devine\n3 Banh Mi, 2 lemon ice tea for 95K.\nHighly recommended.\nRead more\nWritten March 1, 2026",
